{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01527",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 5.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Welcome. Make yourself comfortable. Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.06,
      "end_seconds": 11.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Ah, I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.39,
      "end_seconds": 15.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.78,
      "end_seconds": 24.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Right, I've been dealing with a headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.54,
      "end_seconds": 29.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.45,
      "end_seconds": 42.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.51,
      "end_seconds": 68.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature 36.6, heart rate 85, pressure 125 over 74. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.09,
      "end_seconds": 72.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.99,
      "end_seconds": 82.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.66,
      "end_seconds": 115.82,
      "duration_seconds": 33.16,
      "text": "It comes and goes. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. Let me think, as for neck pain after a car crash, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Sorry, what was I saying, about neck pain after a car crash, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.86,
      "end_seconds": 120.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Any sign of chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.75,
      "end_seconds": 124.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "No, you know, none, no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.64,
      "end_seconds": 131.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Did you get loss of consciousness, numbness in the arms or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.18,
      "end_seconds": 135.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Okay, so none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.14,
      "end_seconds": 139.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.79,
      "end_seconds": 143.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "No, um, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.24,
      "end_seconds": 148.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Well, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.35,
      "end_seconds": 167.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.06,
      "end_seconds": 180.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. My husband and I live above the shop. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.69,
      "end_seconds": 187.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.9,
      "end_seconds": 194.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Heart disease, for two years. Migraines, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.45,
      "end_seconds": 203.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease is known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.62,
      "end_seconds": 209.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I take metoprolol, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Okay, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.9,
      "end_seconds": 220.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "It's 50 milligrams. Propranolol, twice a day for the migraine prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.81,
      "end_seconds": 223.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.31,
      "end_seconds": 237.46,
      "duration_seconds": 12.15,
      "text": "40 milligrams. Hmm, I'm on ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, with food. I'd been on clopidogrel, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.06,
      "end_seconds": 242.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.65,
      "end_seconds": 247.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Okay, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.62,
      "end_seconds": 261.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "There is muscle tenderness either side of the neck and no tenderness over the bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.26,
      "end_seconds": 276.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Okay, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.36,
      "end_seconds": 282.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.33,
      "end_seconds": 306.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I'd lean towards whiplash-type neck strain. We shouldn't forget a cervical spine injury. Today I'm not changing anything. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.08,
      "end_seconds": 310.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}